(<hi rendition="#aq"><placeName>Brug-Drift</placeName></hi>), den <placeName>Stromfluß</placeName> (<hi rendition="#aq"><placeName>Stroom-Drift</placeName></hi>), den<lb/>
<placeName>Pfriemenfluß</placeName> (<hi rendition="#aq"><placeName>El&#x017F;e-Rivier</placeName></hi>) und den <placeName>tiefen Fluß</placeName><lb/>
